    320 by 180 an inset plate would be plate-on-plate and read as a flat block, so
    the banner itself is the plate and the amber forms sit directly on it. Only the
    two section 15 gradients appear.

    FONT SUBSTITUTION: section 15 specifies Inter SemiBold. Inter is not installed on
    the build machine, so the wordmark outlines below were taken from Segoe UI
    Semibold (C:\Windows\Fonts\seguisb.ttf) at 25px with -1% tracking, converted to
    path data. Regenerate from Inter SemiBold when the font is available.
-->
